{"sections":[{"slug":"MO","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"MO"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“MO”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“MO”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>$MO$ <span lang=\"zh\">是万有</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Thom谱","text":"Thom <span lang=\"zh\">谱</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>$\\pi_n MO$ <span lang=\"zh\">可自然等同于闭</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">维流形的配边类的集合</span>.</p>\n<p>$MO$ <span lang=\"zh\">是如下余极限</span>,\n$$\r\nMO\\simeq\\operatorname{colim}\\big(BO \\overset{J}{\\to} BGL_1(\\mathbb S) \\to \\mathsf {Spectra}\\big),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">即是</span> $BO$ <span lang=\"zh\">上万有球丛的全空间</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}